cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
title: "route51-fleet-planning: Fleet Planning Console and Route 51 pipeline"
abstract: >-
  Fleet Planning Console and the five-layer Route 51 pipeline (synthetic data
  generation, privacy aggregation, data fusion, NSGA-II headway optimisation,
  SUMO microsimulation and economic evaluation) accompanying the master's thesis
  "An AI System Architecture for Urban Bus Service Optimisation Based on
  Aggregated Telecom and ATTO Fare-Payment Data: Design and Simulation-Based
  Evaluation on a Tashkent Corridor" (IT Park University, 2026). Results release
  route51_v2_20260922. All data are synthetic.
authors:
